  "scope_narrative": {
    "value": "Installation of exhaust fans in the crawlspace of Building 1046 (Dental Clinic), Shaw AFB, SC to correct pressurization deficiencies identified in the DHA Infrastructure Condition Assessment Survey. Scope includes approximately 4,000 CFM exhaust fan with BAS integration, fire damper, ductwork to roof, and intake/exhaust hoods. Electrical scope connects EF-1 to power. Design references UFC 3-401-01, UFC 3-410-01, IMC-2010, ASHRAE 62.1-2007, NFPA 70, and UFC 4-510-01.",
    "source": "BOD — Mechanical and Electrical sections",
